{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x14---barts-comet",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x14 - Bart's Comet",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x14 - Bart's Comet.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:06:05.701Z",
  "lineCount": 200,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "BART'S COMET",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 3832,
      "endMs": 5242
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "And now, to top off...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 30577,
      "endMs": 32154
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "...our most propane-explosion-free Science Week ever...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 32322,
      "endMs": 35007
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "...our grand finale: The launching of a weather balloon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 35208,
      "endMs": 38228
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Go, weather balloon! Hurrah for science, whoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 39940,
      "endMs": 43262
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "\"Hurrah for science, whoo\"?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 43463,
      "endMs": 45577
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "I can't say I approve of the \"whoo,\" but the \"hurrah\" was quite heartening.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 45745,
      "endMs": 49604
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Release the balloon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 49772,
      "endMs": 51718
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Yeah! All right!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 51919,
      "endMs": 54268
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 67322,
      "endMs": 70678
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "I don't think I really captured the eyes. Bart, if you have a failing...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 74767,
      "endMs": 78200
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "...it's that you're always demanding perfection.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 78367,
      "endMs": 80600
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "If you have a failing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 80767,
      "endMs": 82133
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Whoever brings down that balloon doesn't have to learn fractions.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 82300,
      "endMs": 86200
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Careful, children. That's my car.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 90300,
      "endMs": 92033
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Destroy that balloon. Aye.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 96033,
      "endMs": 99133
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Tango 14, we're being fired at. I'm getting an ID on the bogey now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 102983,
      "endMs": 106475
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Iraqis again. Launching Sidewinder missile.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 110000,
      "endMs": 112678
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Missed him. Launching second Sidewinder missile.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 116271,
      "endMs": 119322
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "This is what happens when you cut money out of the military...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 123966,
      "endMs": 126915
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "...and put it into healthcare. - It's a good program.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 127085,
      "endMs": 129559
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Just give it a chance, that's all I ask.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 129695,
      "endMs": 132373
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "It won't come down for months. Curse the man who invented helium.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 138746,
      "endMs": 141898
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Curse Pierre Jules C�sar Janssen.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 142068,
      "endMs": 144373
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Now to find out who did this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 144881,
      "endMs": 147051
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Bart, empty your pockets. Empty my pockets, you say?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 147559,
      "endMs": 150576
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Well, certainly, but I fail to see how...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 150746,
      "endMs": 154678
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Blueprints of the dummy, notarized photos of you making the dummy...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 154881,
      "endMs": 159085
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "...and an alternate wording for the banner.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 159322,
      "endMs": 161322
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Race you to Utah, Milhouse. Okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 162915,
      "endMs": 166169
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "I am going to punish you for this, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 166780,
      "endMs": 169051
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "And it won't just be a simple caning this time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 169220,
      "endMs": 171559
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Because you have impeded science, you must now aid science.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 171729,
      "endMs": 176508
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Yes. Starting tomorrow, you will assist me with my amateur astronomy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 176678,
      "endMs": 181254
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Taking down coordinates, carrying equipment and so forth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 181424,
      "endMs": 184203
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Four-thirty in the morning. There's a 4:30 in the morning now?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 184373,
      "endMs": 187186
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Top of the hour, time for the news. But of course, there is no news yet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 190167,
      "endMs": 194133
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Everyone's still asleep in their comfy, comfy beds. Good night, everybody.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 194300,
      "endMs": 199000
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Still dark. Better use the generator.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 209133,
      "endMs": 211933
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "There's nothing more exciting than science.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 225633,
      "endMs": 227567
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "You get all the fun of sitting still, being quiet...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 227733,
      "endMs": 230467
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "...writing down numbers, paying attention.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 230633,
      "endMs": 233100
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Science has it all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 233267,
      "endMs": 234667
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Is that the telescope we'll look through?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 234867,
      "endMs": 236800
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Yes, but you won't be looking through it. I forbid it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 236967,
      "endMs": 240133
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "But you don't need a telescope to enjoy astronomy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 240267,
      "endMs": 242600
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "There are all the constellations you've heard so much about.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 242767,
      "endMs": 245500
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "There's Orion, the Swan, the Chariot Race.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 245767,
      "endMs": 249133
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Why don't they look anything like their names?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 249300,
      "endMs": 251467
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "You do have to use your imagination.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 251700,
      "endMs": 253367
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Look, there's the Three Wise Men.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 253567,
      "endMs": 255733
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Who names these things?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 255867,
      "endMs": 257233
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Whoever discovers them. I've been hoping I can find something...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 257467,
      "endMs": 260267
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "...that would be named after me. - You've never found anything?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 260500,
      "endMs": 263367
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Once. But by the time I got to a phone...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 263500,
      "endMs": 266133
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "...my discovery had already been reported by Principal Kohoutek.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 266300,
      "endMs": 270167
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "I got back at him, though. Him and that little boy of his.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 270333,
      "endMs": 275230
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Anyway, that's why I always keep a cellular phone next to me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 276276,
      "endMs": 279138
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Now, this morning we're gonna be mapping...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 279276,
      "endMs": 281241
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "...a square of sky that's thought to be empty. I hope it's not.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 281414,
      "endMs": 284448
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "So, what am I supposed to do exactly?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 284621,
      "endMs": 286690
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Just write down my findings as I give them to you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 286966,
      "endMs": 289448
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Six hours, 19 minutes right ascension, 14 degrees, 22 minutes declination.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 289586,
      "endMs": 294690
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "No sighting.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 295276,
      "endMs": 296724
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Six hours, 19 minutes right ascension, 14 degrees, 23 minutes declination.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 297276,
      "endMs": 302552
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "No sighting.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 303448,
      "endMs": 305000
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Six hours, 19 minutes right ascension, 14 degrees, 58 minutes declination.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 305414,
      "endMs": 310931
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "No sighting. Did you get that one, Bart?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 311961,
      "endMs": 313807
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Hell, no. Good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 313975,
      "endMs": 315652
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "My stars. Give me the phone, quick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 316122,
      "endMs": 318672
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Check out 6-19-14-59.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 321055,
      "endMs": 324813
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "No. No, there's no need for that. It's already named after me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 331726,
      "endMs": 336089
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "It's pretty close to the ground. Maybe I can catch it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 336256,
      "endMs": 338941
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Don't touch the telescope, Bart. Even a slight change in elevation...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 339109,
      "endMs": 343169
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "...can destroy a whole morning's work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 343303,
      "endMs": 345485
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "All hands on deck. Pirates off the port bow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 351458,
      "endMs": 354579
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Hey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 354679,
      "endMs": 356760
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Observatory? This is Bart Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 362297,
      "endMs": 364813
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "I see something in the sky at 4-12-8, and the last number is seven.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 364981,
      "endMs": 370015
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "What did you do today, Bart?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 404271,
      "endMs": 405840
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "What didn't I do?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 405973,
      "endMs": 408142
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "\"Boy Discovers Comet.\" What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 408409,
      "endMs": 410211
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "\"A young Springfieldianite has discovered a new comet...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 410378,
      "endMs": 413215
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "...to be known as the Bart Simpson Comet.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 413382,
      "endMs": 415617
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Oh, honey, I'm so proud of you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 415851,
      "endMs": 418487
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "But then you've always been proud of me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 418587,
      "endMs": 421190
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 421958,
      "endMs": 423326
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Won't you join us, Bart?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 428799,
      "endMs": 430735
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "I guess so.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 435473,
      "endMs": 436808
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "As the first student at Springfield Elementary to discover a comet...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 436975,
      "endMs": 441180
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "...we're very proud to make you a member of our very select group.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 441347,
      "endMs": 445318
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Welcome to Super Friends!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 445551,
      "endMs": 448355
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Welcome, Super Friend!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 449022,
      "endMs": 450991
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "I am called Ham, since I enjoy Ham Radio.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 451158,
      "endMs": 455229
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "This is E-Mail, Cosine, Report Card, Database and Lisa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 455362,
      "endMs": 461970
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Your nickname will be Cosmos.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 462137,
      "endMs": 464740
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Well, I'm done eating. Goodbye.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 466875,
      "endMs": 468310
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Goodbye, Cosmos. Bye-bye.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 468511,
      "endMs": 471314
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Perhaps some night you could show us your comet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 471481,
      "endMs": 473750
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "There it is right there. I make it a point...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 473917,
      "endMs": 476119
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "...never turn my head unless I expect to see something.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 476253,
      "endMs": 478889
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Naturally, we can't see your comet in broad daylight and without a telescope.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 479089,
      "endMs": 483728
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "But you don't need a stupid telescope. It's right there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 483962,
      "endMs": 487066
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Oh, no, no! This isn't right at all!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 487734,
      "endMs": 490470
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "It must be coming toward us at a fantastic speed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 490704,
      "endMs": 493974
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Don't you realize what's happening? Your comet will collide with Earth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 494708,
      "endMs": 497945
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Everything in its path will be killed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 498079,
      "endMs": 500014
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "I knew you'd try to find something wrong with my comet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 500214,
      "endMs": 502884
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "You've always been petty and small, right from the beginning.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 503018,
      "endMs": 506255
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "We must alert the proper authorities. To the observatory!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 506455,
      "endMs": 510626
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "We are the Super Friends Hey, shut up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 514764,
      "endMs": 518468
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Dear God! Warren...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 523574,
      "endMs": 525009
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "...we've talked about you hogging the eyepiece.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 525209,
      "endMs": 527979
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Sounds like the Doomsday Whistle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 533018,
      "endMs": 535287
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Ain't been blown for nigh on to three years.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 535588,
      "endMs": 539993
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Trouble a-brewing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 540827,
      "endMs": 542162
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Fellow citizens, when I learned about the impending crisis...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 543564,
      "endMs": 546634
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "...I caught the very next plane to Springfeld. Field.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 546801,
      "endMs": 549937
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "First, yes, there is a comet in the sky. And yes, it is going to hit Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 552641,
      "endMs": 557646
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "You don't need to applaud that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 559682,
      "endMs": 561217
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Now, here's what we think the impact might look like.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 561384,
      "endMs": 564521
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Show them, Jerry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 564687,
      "endMs": 566456
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Oh, dear God, no!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 572329,
      "endMs": 573764
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Fortunately, we have a plan. Professor Frink?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 576068,
      "endMs": 578504
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "Hi. Good evening, ladies and...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 578704,
      "endMs": 580339
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Einstein, what's the plan?!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 580506,
      "endMs": 582742
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "All right, just take your seat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 583109,
      "endMs": 584878
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Now, working with former Carter-administration officials...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 585111,
      "endMs": 587914
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "...and military men who were forced into early retirement...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 588048,
      "endMs": 590851
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "For various reasons which we won't go into here, okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 591051,
      "endMs": 593754
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "We have planned this defense for the city.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 593955,
      "endMs": 596357
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "As the comet hurdles toward the city, our rocket will intercept it...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 596624,
      "endMs": 600662
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "...and blow it to smithereens. Right!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 600796,
      "endMs": 602831
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "That will be the end of our Mr. Comet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 607203,
      "endMs": 608771
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "We're saved!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 609172,
      "endMs": 610840
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Will you all stop worrying about that stupid comet? It's going to be destroyed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 621352,
      "endMs": 624923
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Didn't you hear what that guy in the building said?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 625157,
      "endMs": 627593
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "But, Dad, don't you think...? Lisa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 627726,
      "endMs": 629762
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "The reason we have elected officials is so we don't have to think all the time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 630029,
      "endMs": 634601
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Just like that rain-forest scare a few years back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 634767,
      "endMs": 637771
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Our officials saw there was a problem, and they fixed it, didn't they?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 638004,
      "endMs": 641275
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "No, Dad. I don't think... There's that word again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 641475,
      "endMs": 644078
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Homer, what if this doesn't work? Well, then I have a backup plan.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 666604,
      "endMs": 670141
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "See, while the unprepared are still sitting around...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 670308,
      "endMs": 672944
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "...twiddling their thumbs and going:",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 673111,
      "endMs": 675881
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Dad! So anyway, we get in our car...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 681101,
      "endMs": 683003
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "...and take the bridge out of town. While all the while, they're still going:",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 683170,
      "endMs": 687809
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Dad, they're firing the rocket!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 690745,
      "endMs": 693148
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "All right!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 695250,
      "endMs": 696885
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "It blew up the bridge! We're doomed!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 711502,
      "endMs": 713972
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "It's times like this I wish I were a religious man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 714138,
      "endMs": 717375
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "It's all over, people! We don't have a prayer!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 717509,
      "endMs": 722581
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "And like Icarus, the rocket foolishly soared too high...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 732761,
      "endMs": 735731
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "...and lost control of its servo-guidance mechanism...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 737800,
      "endMs": 739802
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "...leaving us with some...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 739902,
      "endMs": 742072
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "...six hours to live.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 742238,
      "endMs": 744007
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "So let's go live now to the charred remains of the only bridge out of town...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 744207,
      "endMs": 748145
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "...with Arnie Pie and \"Arnie in the Sky.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 748445,
      "endMs": 751115
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "With the bridge gone and the airport on the other side of the bridge...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 751249,
      "endMs": 754853
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "...a number of citizens are attempting to jump the gorge with their cars.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 755053,
      "endMs": 758523
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "It's a silent testament to the never-give-up...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 758757,
      "endMs": 761293
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "...and never-think-things-out spirit of our citizens.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 761427,
      "endMs": 764597
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "With our annihilation imminent, our government has snapped into action.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 764764,
      "endMs": 768068
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "We go live now via satellite to the floor of the United States Congress.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 768268,
      "endMs": 771705
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Hey, I got an idea.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1033506,
      "endMs": 1035208
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "We can play a game to pass the time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1035374,
      "endMs": 1037877
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "I'll make the sound of a barnyard animal, and you all try to guess what it is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1038078,
      "endMs": 1043450
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "It's a pig. It's a cow, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1047955,
      "endMs": 1049691
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "It's a pony. No, it's a goat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1049858,
      "endMs": 1051726
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "You know, one of them lady goats. There are no lady goats.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1051860,
      "endMs": 1054663
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "A lady goat is a sheep. I believe she's right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1054830,
      "endMs": 1057099
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "You're crazy. What's it to you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1057333,
      "endMs": 1059368
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "What's it to me? Hey, it's a pony!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1059535,
      "endMs": 1061704
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Shut up! Doesn't anybody care that I'm hungry?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1061905,
      "endMs": 1064541
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Stop it, stop it. Can't you see this barnyard-noise guessing game...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1064741,
      "endMs": 1068479
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "...is tearing us apart?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1068679,
      "endMs": 1071015
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Say, Moe, was it a duck?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1077856,
      "endMs": 1080359
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "I don't like it...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1082094,
      "endMs": 1084263
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "No! No! Shut up! Shut up! Stop it! Stop it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1084430,
      "endMs": 1089135
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "I can't take this anymore.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1089336,
      "endMs": 1090971
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "I can't let that brave man out there die alone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1091104,
      "endMs": 1094241
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "I'm surprised and disgusted by all of you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1094441,
      "endMs": 1097178
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Especially his children.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1097478,
      "endMs": 1099347
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "I'm going out there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1099514,
      "endMs": 1101349
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "And it was a baby ox.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1102551,
      "endMs": 1104253
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "He's right, you know. About the ox?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1104419,
      "endMs": 1106121
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "About everything, damn it! Hey, Homer, wait up. I wanna die too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1106288,
      "endMs": 1110827
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "If you are going, I am going. Me too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1110993,
      "endMs": 1112929
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Me too. I'm out of here. Make way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1113062,
      "endMs": 1115532
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Radio reception in there sucked.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1117568,
      "endMs": 1118515
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Run!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1156313,
      "endMs": 1157848
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Look! It's breaking up!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1164088,
      "endMs": 1166224
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Cool. We're saved!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1179439,
      "endMs": 1182876
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Sure makes you appreciate the preciousness of life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1184578,
      "endMs": 1188649
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Let's go burn down the observatory so this'll never happen again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1189851,
      "endMs": 1194122
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "I can't believe that extra-thick layer of pollution that I've picketed against...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1196158,
      "endMs": 1200096
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "...is what burned up the comet. - What's really amazing...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1200263,
      "endMs": 1203099
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "...is that this is exactly what Dad said would happen.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1203233,
      "endMs": 1207638
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Yeah. Dad was right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1207804,
      "endMs": 1209773
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "I know, kids. I'm scared too. www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1209940,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 6,
    "episode": 14
  }
}
